		(at 10.5 15.4)
		(descr "PROVISIONAL two-sided exposed-copper M3 bolt land for a vertical daughterboard fastened to the threaded side face of XFCN T34069. The supplied M3 screw and washer pass through the daughterboard and clamp its copper land against the terminal face; the four terminal legs solder only to the horizontal main PCB. The 3.4 mm plated normal-clearance hole, washer envelope, screw-axis height, and board-edge datum require incoming-part measurement before release. Add symmetric via stitching immediately outside the washer/contact area.")
